The demo data set is NOT under the Apache License. It carries text from Wikipedia.

Files:
  embeddings_tumbler/static/demo-wikipedia.json   (the records: titles and short texts)
  embeddings_tumbler/static/demo-wikipedia.f32    (the vectors embedded from those texts)
  data/wikipedia-vital-3/corpus.jsonl             (the corpus they were built from; source
                                                   distribution and repository only)

Source: English Wikipedia, https://en.wikipedia.org/ . The articles are those linked
from the list "Wikipedia:Vital articles/Level 3",
https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Vital_articles/Level/3 , revision 1385567416
(https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=1385567416), retrieved 2026-11-14.

Authors: Wikipedia contributors. Each point records the Wikipedia page id and the
revision id its text was read from; the article and the list of its authors (its
history) are at https://en.wikipedia.org/?curid=<page id> and
https://en.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=<revision id>&action=history .

