that licence states.

Changes made: each text is the first one or two sentences of the article's
introduction, as plain text without markup, with web addresses removed, cut to at most
280 characters at a word boundary (an ellipsis marks a cut). The vectors are the
output of an embedding model given those texts; the data file names the model.

To rebuild: python3 scripts/build_demo_corpus.py --revision 1385567416 and then
python3 scripts/build_demo_set.py --apply (see the scripts' own documentation).
